being here, man.

00:00:20.386 --> 00:00:23.122
-Yeah. You didn't slow down
during the pandemic.

00:00:23.122 --> 00:00:24.857
-Oh, no.
-You released two albums.

00:00:24.857 --> 00:00:26.960
