00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.695
-Latin Grammys. Yeah.
-Congratulations.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:29.763
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Thank you.

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:30.863
-That's what I'm talking about,
man.

00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:32.465
I love that.
-Thank you, man. Yeah.

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:33.733
Super-excited.

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:36.335
-How different is it
