00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:57.790
was just waking up in my pj's,

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:00.660
just going straight to
the studio and making music.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:04.597
That's how I actually made
two albums in one year, man.

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:06.165
-That's crazy.
That's a lot of work.

00:01:06.165 --> 00:01:08.601
-Yeah, I did
"7DJ (7 Días en Jamaica)"

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:10.836
and then I did
"Papi Juancho" also.

00:01:10.836 --> 00:01:13.972
And, well, "Hawái" --
that was, like, my main song,

00:01:13.972 --> 00:01:15.074
one of the biggest songs.

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:16.442
[ Cheers and applause ]
-That's right.

00:01:16.442 --> 00:01:18.978
-It's the one that is nominated
to the Latin Grammys.

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:22.248
And we just won two
Billboard Awards, too,

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:23.249
with "Hawái."

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:26.286
So it was a weird year for me,

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:28.354
but, at the same time, it was
pretty productive, you know?

00:01:28.354 --> 00:01:29.422
-Yeah, it was very fruitful.
Yeah.

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:30.490
-It was just beautiful, too.

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:31.991
-I've read up
a little bit about you

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:33.859
