"Papi Juancho."

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:48.434
-Yeah, I like "Papi Juancho."

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:50.102
[ Cheers and applause ]
It does sound good.

00:02:50.102 --> 00:02:51.303
"Papi Juancho"!

00:02:51.303 --> 00:02:54.273
